	<entry>
		<title type="html"><![CDATA[Réponse à&#160;:  changer le nom des fichier log]]></title>
		<link rel="alternate" href="http://forums.postgresql.fr/viewtopic.php?pid=18046#p18046"/>
		<content type="html"><![CDATA[<p>oui :</p><p>lc_messages = &#039;fr_FR.UTF-8&#039;&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; # locale for system error message<br />&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; # strings<br />lc_monetary = &#039;fr_FR.UTF-8&#039;&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; # locale for monetary formatting<br />lc_numeric = &#039;fr_FR.UTF-8&#039;&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; # locale for number formatting<br />lc_time = &#039;fr_FR.UTF-8&#039;</p>]]></content>
